                    ORDER SETTING PREHEARING CONFERENCE

       THIS MATTER comes before Christopher P. Ryan and Patrick C. Schaefer, hearing

examiners for the New Mexico Public Regulation Commission (“Commission”), upon their own

motion. Being duly informed, the hearing examiners FIND and CONCLUDE that a prehearing

conference should be scheduled to establish a hearing setting and address attendant procedural

matters.

       It is therefore ORDERED:

       A. A prehearing conference shall be held on December 12, 2025, beginning at 2:00 p.m.

MT. The prehearing conference shall be held via the Zoom video-conferencing platform. Before

the prehearing conference, the hearing examiners will send a Zoom meeting invitation to the

persons on the attached Certificate of Service.

       B. Prior to the prehearing conference, counsel for PNM shall discuss and attempt to reach

agreement with counsel for the Utility Division Staff of the Commission and any intervenors and

known likely intervenors on a proposed procedural schedule.

       ISSUED under the seal of the Commission at Santa Fe, New Mexico, this 8th day of

December, 2025.

                      NEW MEXICO PUBLIC REGULATION COMMISSION


                      ___________________________
                      Patrick Schaefer
                      Hearing Examiner
